<title>THAILAND: Thai Dec trade deficit narrows to 22.3 bln baht.</title>
<headline>Thai Dec trade deficit narrows to 22.3 bln baht.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Thailand said on Thursday Thailand's December trade deficit narrowed to 22.3 billion baht from a revised 24.2 billion in November and against 29.4 billion a year ago.</p>
<p>    MERCHANDISE TRADE     Dec 96     Nov 96	 Dec 95</p>
<p>	  Exports	     117.0	120.8	  119.1</p>
<p>	  Imports	     139.3	145.0	  148.5</p>
<p>	  Trade balance     -22.3	-24.2	  -29.4</p>
<p>Note - Figures in billions of baht.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok Newsroom (662)-252-9950</p>
</text>
